            "step_title": "Rebuild & Protect Cartilage",
            "step_description": "Glucosamine & Chondroitin work together to help restore joint cushioning, slow cartilage breakdown, and improve flexibility.\n\nThink of them as the foundation — strengthening your dog’s joints from the inside out.",
