            "step_title": "Calm Inflammation & Discomfort",
            "step_description": "MSM, Green-Lipped Mussel, Yucca & Omega-3s naturally target cellular inflammation that causes stiffness and soreness.\n\nThis eases discomfort and keeps your pup moving more comfortably day-to-day.",
            "content_background_color": "#f7ebe1"
          }
        },
        "step_Tk8jPB": {
